{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2242","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2242","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2242\",\"parent_revision\":\"3554b0573e7a8a2c270d69fa2a18c7bfb26993ea\",\"root_revision\":\"6c9c8f56bca798b01b1d7cf3e66cbdc02615c08fed1255063c979bf6abb1a6ac\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Fact-Check\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**Claim 1**: `AcceptanceCriterion` model exists at `models.py:365-390` with no `trending_metric` field.\\nverdict: VERIFIED\\nevidence: Read `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/models.py` lines 365-390. Class `AcceptanceCriterion(BaseModel)` confirmed at line 365 with fields: `criterion_id`, `description`, `check_command`, `expected_baseline`, `expected_final`. No `trending_metric` field present. Grep for `trending_metric` in models.py returned 0 results.\\nsource: `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/models.py:365-390`\\n\\n**Claim 2**: `BookendVerification` model at `models.py:421-449` has no `metric_history` field.\\nverdict: VERIFIED\\nevidence: Read `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/models.py` lines 421-449. Class `BookendVerification(BaseModel)` confirmed at line 421 with fields: `criterion_id`, `check_command`, `t0_exit_code`, `tn_exit_code`, `status`, `stdout_diff_summary`. No `metric_history` field present.\\nsource: `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/models.py:421-449`\\n\\n**Claim 3**: `AcceptanceCriterion` uses `AliasChoices` pattern for all fields.\\nverdict: VERIFIED\\nevidence: Grep `AliasChoices` in models.py. Lines 375, 379, 383, 388 all confirm `validation_alias=AliasChoices(...)` and `serialization_alias=...` on all fields. Pattern is consistent throughout.\\nsource: `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/models.py:375-390`\\n\\n**Claim 4**: `TestAcceptanceCriterionModel` exists at